    <content>
      <![CDATA[<h2 id="1-1-为什么用-UniTask"><a href="#1-1-为什么用-UniTask" class="headerlink" title="1.1 为什么用 UniTask"></a>1.1 为什么用 UniTask</h2><p>Unity 原生的 <code>async/await</code> 基于 <code>Task</code>，会产生 GC 分配。UniTask 使用结构体 + 对象池，在异步场景下几乎零 GC，更适合游戏高频逻辑。</p><div class="note warning flat"><p>使用 UniTask 时务必传入 <code>CancellationToken</code>，否则物体销毁后异步任务仍在执行，会造成内存泄漏。</p></div><h2 id="1-2-基础用法"><a href="#1-2-基础用法" class="headerlink" title="1.2 基础用法"></a>1.2 基础用法</h2><figure class="highlight csharp"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">using</span> Cysharp.Threading.Tasks;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">using</span> UnityEngine;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="keyword">class</span> <span class="title">UniTaskDemo</span> : <span class="title">MonoBehaviour</span></span><br><span class="line">&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="function"><span class="keyword">async</span> UniTaskVoid <span class="title">Start</span>()</span></span><br><span class="line">    &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        Debug.Log(<span class="string">&quot;等待 1 秒&quot;</span>);</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">await</span> UniTask.Delay(<span class="number">1000</span>);</span><br><span class="line">        Debug.Log(<span class="string">&quot;1 秒到了&quot;</span>);</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="1-3-异步等待按钮点击"><a href="#1-3-异步等待按钮点击" class="headerlink" title="1.3 异步等待按钮点击"></a>1.3 异步等待按钮点击</h2><figure class="highlight csharp"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">using</span> UnityEngine.UI;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="keyword">class</span> <span class="title">ButtonDemo</span> : <span class="title">MonoBehaviour</span></span><br><span class="line">&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    [<span class="meta">SerializeField</span>] Button _button;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="function"><span class="keyword">async</span> UniTaskVoid <span class="title">Start</span>()</span></span><br><span class="line">    &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="comment">// 等待一次按钮点击，销毁时自动取消</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">var</span> token = <span class="keyword">this</span>.GetCancellationTokenOnDestroy();</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">await</span> _button.OnClickAsync(token);</span><br><span class="line">        Debug.Log(<span class="string">&quot;按钮被点击了&quot;</span>);</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="1-4-注意事项"><a href="#1-4-注意事项" class="headerlink" title="1.4 注意事项"></a>1.4 注意事项</h2><ol><li>必须传入 <code>CancellationToken</code>，物体销毁时取消任务</li><li>轮询场景可以用 <code>UniTask.WaitUntil</code> 替代协程</li><li>不支持 <code>await</code> 的地方，可以用 <code>UniTaskVoid</code> 启动</li></ol>]]>
    </content>
